      "side": 1,
      "message": "HeaderFilterRegex is evaluated by clang-tidy using LLVM’s POSIX ERE regex engine, which does not support the negative look-ahead in (?!^subprojects).*. This can cause header diagnostics to be filtered out unexpectedly. Could we use supported include/exclude filters instead?",
