      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you have a reproducer showing this pattern is not working? It\u0027s currently used in several OpenBMC repositories to exclude subprojects/. Also this based on https://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/master/style/cpp/.clang-tidy",
