      "writtenOn": "2026-10-15T12:57:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the reproducer. Since LLVM 14 is quite old, could you provide a clang-tidy-23 reproducer showing an actual filtering issue caused by this pattern? I tested with clang-tidy-22 and didn\u0027t observe any unexpected behavior, so I\u0027d like to understand the practical impact before changing the configuration.",
      "parentUuid": "316a55b4_eabeae83",
      "revId": "4407d7e6f2f940df4775c4bdc95f9125aad0623b",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
